            "sid": "REV 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakuso isithunywa sebandla elisePergamo loba uthi: Nanku akutshoyo lowo olomhedla obukhali inxa zombili, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uthi: Ngiyazi lapho wakhe khona, lapho kukhona isihlalo sobukhosi sikaSathane; kanti ubambelele ebizweni lami, kawuphikanga ukukholwa kwakho lasensukwini zikaAntipasi, ufakazi wami othembekileyo, owabulawelwa phakathi kwenu lapho uSathane ahlala khona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa kukhona okuyingcosana engilakho ngawe; ulabo lapho ababambelela ekufundiseni kukaBalami, owafundisa uBalaki ukubeka isikhubekiso phambi kwabakoIsrayeli sokuba badle okuhlatshelwe izithombe lokuba baphinge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
