          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngizakubulala abantwana bakhe. Wonke amabandla azakwazi ukuthi nginguye ohlola ingqondo lenhliziyo, futhi ngizakumnika ilowo lalowo wenu ngokwemisebenzi yakhe.",
          "type": "text",
